msgid "KSame"
msgstr "KSame"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.ksame.appdata.xml:7
msgid "Game mode of Klickety, which is an adaptation of the \"clickomania\" game"
msgstr "Način igre Klicketyja, prilagodbe igre „Clickomania”"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.ksame.appdata.xml:9
msgid "KSame is a simple, yet challenging color matching game modeled after once famous game of SameGame. The idea behind KSame is to completely clear the game board filled with the multicolored marbles."
msgstr "KSame je jednostavna, ali izazovna igra uparivanja boja, nastala prema nekoć popularnoj igri SameGame. Cilj je potpuno očistiti ploču ispunjenu raznobojnim kuglicama."